              "text": "قيد — qayd — \"a shackle; a restriction\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وضعت الشرطة القيد في يدي اللص. waḍaʿat ash-shurṭa al-qayd fī yaday al-liṣṣ. The police put the handcuffs on the thief’s hands."
