          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أفرج (afraja) is built on the native Arabic root f-r-j (Lane), \"to open a gap; to relieve\"; faraj is relief from trouble. It is Form IV, \"to open the way out\"."
            }
          ]
